chain: TS3005
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series TS3005a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: max_cost | decision | Maximum production cost (euro) | amount:number
object: devices | decision | Devices the remote controls | outcome:enum[televisions only,multiple devices]
object: lcd | decision | LCD screen | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: auto_shutdown | decision | Shut down with the television | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: standby | decision | Standby when idle | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: battery_indicator | decision | Low battery indicator | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: battery | decision | Battery type | outcome:enum[rechargeable,conventional]
object: charger | decision | Charger or docking station | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: button_zoom | decision | Enlargeable buttons | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: buttons | decision | Physical buttons | outcome:enum[button-less,physical buttons]
object: pen | decision | Pen | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: case_curve | decision | Case curvature | outcome:enum[single curved,double curved]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[rubber,wood]
object: speech | decision | Speech recognition | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: scroll | decision | Scrolling device | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: chip | decision | Chip | outcome:enum[simple chip,advanced chip]

